1. MIT LICENSE — the author's software
================================================================================

Applies to the build, harness and analysis code written for this study:

  src/                     the measurement library (ccstudy) and the Node adapters
  scripts/                 the harness, analysis, figure/table and audit-sampling
                           scripts, including the shell script
                           scripts/reproduce_analysis.sh
  experiments/pmd-cc.xml, experiments/sandbox/pmd-cc.xml,
  experiments/sandbox/.oxlintrc.json                   tool configuration
  experiments/sandbox*/, experiments/go_err_probe/     author-written probe inputs
  experiments/ccts_probe/a2.ts, a3.ts                  author-written probe inputs
  experiments/microcorpus/{python,java,javascript,go}/ the micro-corpus sources,
                           EXCEPT the cases derived from the white paper's worked
                           examples, which regime 3 covers

