Applies to the measurements, tables, figures and written research record:

  data/                    the corpus selection and its manifests
  results/                 raw tool outputs and processed result tables
  figures/                 the generated figures
  tables/                  the generated tables
  experiments/microcorpus/expected.csv     the expected values, ambiguity labels,
